ming to it, please?\", \"Actually, please forget it — never mind.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0013\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to work out how packed things look for me, so how many tasks have I got due next week?\", \"Different thing — I want to plan my day properly, so what's on tomorrow?\", \"Honestly I'm not going to manage any of that, so could you move all of them to saturday?\"], [\"umm how many tasks have I got due, uh, next week?\", \"oh and what's on tomorrow?\", \"ok can you... can you just move all of those to saturday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0014\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to plan out the next few days properly, so which tasks have I got due next week?\", \"Sorry, hang on, something just popped into my head — who am I seeing at the brewing?\", \"Right, back to the task list — I've already done the first one so tick that off, and the third one can go, please delete it.\", \"Separate thing, I just want a clear picture of where I'm at — what's left on my to-do list?\"], [\"which tasks next week?\", \"hang on — who's at the brewing?\", \"back to those: tick first, delete third\", \"what's left on my to-dos?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0015\", \"v\": [[\"i visited Roisin, log it pls\", \"it was roisin Wadsworth\", \"what events is she coming to\", \"move the third one to tomorrow n cancel the fifth one\"], [\"I want to keep better track of who I've been seeing lately, so could you log that I visited Roisin?\", \"Sorry, I should've been clearer about that — it was Roisin Wadsworth.\", \"While we're on her, I'm trying to see when we'll next cross paths — what events is she coming to?\", \"Things have shuffled around a bit, so could you move the third one to tomorrow and cancel the fifth one altogether?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0016\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you reserve us a table at Biarritz Lane for, uh, the weekend?\", \"ok fair enough, so what pictures have I got from last week?\", \"oh wait, hang on, what was the last thing I wrote in my journal?\", \"ok going back to the photos from last week — the javelin one, where was that taken?\"], [\"table at Biarritz Lane, the weekend\", \"pics from last week?\", \"wait — last journal entry?\", \"back to those — where's the javelin one from?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0017\", \"v\": [[\"Pryndan, badminton collective — settle up\", \"add chepstow dunes pic to Salento 2027 album\", \"what else is in it?\"], [\"umm so with Pryndan in badminton collective, can we, uh, settle up?\", \"oh and can you add the chepstow dunes picture to the, um, Salento 2027 album\", \"ok and what else is in that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0018\", \"v\": [[\"Pryndan sorted the tickets for all of us, so I want to get it logged — can you add twelve dollars for Pryndan's tickets to badminton collective? They paid for it.\"], [\"umm add twelve dollars for Pryndan's tickets to, uh, badminton collective — they paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0019\", \"v\": [[\"I scribbled some stuff down a while back and can't find it now — can you pull up my handball club notes?\", \"Totally different thing, I'm trying to get the house finances straight — which expenses are in the number 19 house group?\", \"Oh, sorry, quick one before I forget — what do the Salento expenses add up to?\", \"Right, back to the number 19 house stuff — I can't remember what we paid, so how much was the deposit one?\"], [\"umm can you find my, uh, handball club notes?\", \"ok and which expenses are in the number 19 house group?\", \"wait hang on, what do the Salento expenses come to?\", \"ok back to the house ones — how much was the, um, deposit one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0021\", \"v\": [[\"umm who am I, uh, having lunch with on sunday?\"], [\"lunch sunday — who with?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w32-0023\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who my lunch on sunday is with, please?\"], [\"I arranged it ages ago and it's completely slipped my mind, so who's my lunch on sunday with?\"]]}","ttft_ms":33635,"type":"result","duration_ms":49218,"uuid":"516b7f3d-f3a1-4b1e-baa9-7650fa5236a0","ttft_stream_ms":1267